ex:H02R02 a ct:Rule ;
    rdfs:label "Expiry without renewal, mutual agreement, or provider termination on recipient default" ;
    ct:description """10. Termination

This Agreement shall be terminated upon the occurrence of any of the following: (1) The validity period of this Agreement expires and the Parties fail to reach an agreement on renewal; (2) The Parties mutually agree to terminate this Agreement; or (3) Service Provider exercises the right to terminate this Agreement upon a default by Service Recipient.

If this Agreement is terminated by Service Provider upon a default by Service Recipient, Service Provider will not refund the prepaid Service Fee to Service Recipient.""" ;
    ct:kind "TERMINATION" ;
    ct:qualifies ex:H02R01 ;
    ct:supported_by ex:H02R02P .

ex:H02R02P a ct:SourcePassage ;
    ct:end_char 11775 ;
    ct:exact_text """10. Termination

This Agreement shall be terminated upon the occurrence of any of the following: (1) The validity period of this Agreement expires and the Parties fail to reach an agreement on renewal; (2) The Parties mutually agree to terminate this Agreement; or (3) Service Provider exercises the right to terminate this Agreement upon a default by Service Recipient.

If this Agreement is terminated by Service Provider upon a default by Service Recipient, Service Provider will not refund the prepaid Service Fee to Service Recipient.""" ;
    ct:source_path "cuad/RISEEDUCATIONCAYMANLTD_04_17_2020-EX-4.23-SERVICE AGREEMENT.txt" ;
    ct:source_sha256 "4d9af82e13bc95c4459e66c7d19439753237bc89e6e4bf10819aedcc4018534f" ;
    ct:start_char 11236 .

ex:H02R03 a ct:Rule ;
    rdfs:label "Provider may terminate for payment delay exceeding 15 days" ;
    ct:description "In the event that such delay in payment is more than fifteen (15) days, Service Provider may terminate this Agreement. Service Recipient shall be liable for indemnifying Service Provider in full for the losses it incurred therefrom." ;
    ct:kind "TERMINATION" ;
    ct:qualifies ex:H02R01 ;
    ct:supported_by ex:H02R03P .

ex:H02R03P a ct:SourcePassage ;
    ct:end_char 11060 ;
    ct:exact_text "In the event that such delay in payment is more than fifteen (15) days, Service Provider may terminate this Agreement. Service Recipient shall be liable for indemnifying Service Provider in full for the losses it incurred therefrom." ;
    ct:source_path "cuad/RISEEDUCATIONCAYMANLTD_04_17_2020-EX-4.23-SERVICE AGREEMENT.txt" ;
