ex:H11R01 a ct:Rule ;
    rdfs:label "Twelve months, one further twelve-month renewal, and termination on notice" ;
    ct:description """7) Term   The term of this Agreement is twelve (12) months from the date hereof, and will be automatically renewed for one (1) additional twelve month period unless either party shall notify the other in writing of its intention not to renew. Such notice must be given ninety (90) days prior to expiration of the original term. This Agreement may also be terminated by either party upon ninety (90) days written notice.

