    ct:exact_text "6.1 Term.   (i) Term of Agreement. This Agreement shall commence on the Effective Date and, except as set forth in Subsection (ii), continue in full force and effect through the Delivery Period.   (ii) Term of Licenses. Notwithstanding Subsection (i), certain license grants for Content, Images and Affinities extend beyond the expiration or earlier termination of this Agreement as set forth herein. With respect to such Content, Images and Affinities, the terms and conditions of this Agreement shall continue to apply." ;
    ct:source_path "cuad/RemarkHoldingsInc_20081114_10-Q_EX-10.24_2895649_EX-10.24_Content License Agreement.txt" ;
