    ct:exact_text """13. Termination and Payment of Expenses. This Agreement shall become effective on the date hereof and shall terminate upon the termination of the Offering. If for any reason any Shares are not delivered by or on behalf of the Company as provided herein, the Company will reimburse the Agent for all actual and accountable out-of-pocket expenses, including fees and disbursements of counsel, reasonably incurred by the Agent in making preparations for the purchase, sale and delivery of the Shares not so delivered, but the Company shall then be under no further liability to the Agent except as provided in Section 8 and Section 10 hereof.

10""" ;
