ex:H20R02P a ct:SourcePassage ;
    ct:end_char 9190 ;
    ct:exact_text """6.02.  Termination. This Agreement may be terminated only:

(a)  By either party for substantial breach of any material provision of this Agreement by the other, provided due notice has been given to the other of the alleged breach and such other party has not cured the breach within (30) days] thereof; or

(b)  By the Company if: there is an unacceptable change in the control or management of the Distributor; if the Distributor  makes an assignment for the benefit of creditors; if a petition in bankruptcy is filed by or against the Distributor, resulting in an adjudication of bankruptcy; or, if the Distributor fails to pay its debts as they become due and provided due notice has been given by the Company to the Distributor and the Distributor has not cured such breach within thirty (30) days thereof; or   (c)  By the written consent of both parties;

                (d)  Upon termination of this Agreement all further rights and obligations of the parties shall cease, except that Distributor shall not be relieved of (i) its obligation to pay any monies due, or to become due, as of or after the date of termination, and (ii) any other obligation set forth in this Agreement which is to take effect after the date of termination.""" ;
    ct:source_path "cuad/BLACKBOXSTOCKSINC_08_05_2014-EX-10.1-DISTRIBUTOR AGREEMENT.txt" ;
    ct:source_sha256 "0d2edecafe20a5de97f47ed19b08e2df988b3471e3da810944017ec8675adba5" ;
    ct:start_char 7946 .

ex:H02R01 a ct:Rule ;
    rdfs:label "Five-year term with automatic further five years" ;
    ct:description """13. Renewal

This Agreement shall be effective as of the date set forth above in this Agreement. The term of this Agreement shall be five (5) years. This Agreement shall be renewed automatically for another five (5) years upon the expiration unless the Parties confirm, in writing, the termination of this Agreement.""" ;
    ct:duration "P5Y"^^xsd:duration ;
    ct:kind "INITIAL_TERM" ;
    ct:starts_from ex:H02R01F0 ;
    ct:subject_to ex:H02R01C ;
    ct:supported_by ex:H02R01P .

ex:H03R01 a ct:Rule ;
    rdfs:label "Standstill period ends at certification of 2018 annual-meeting vote" ;
    ct:applies_within ex:H03R01F0 ;
    ct:description "(f) For purposes of this Agreement, \"Standstill Period\" shall mean the period commencing on the date of this Agreement and ending at 11:59 p.m. Eastern Time on the date of the certification of the vote of stockholders at the 2018 Annual Meeting." ;
    ct:ends_on_event ex:H03R01F1 ;
    ct:kind "INITIAL_TERM" ;
    ct:subject_to ex:H03R01C ;
    ct:supported_by ex:H03R01P .

ex:H05R01 a ct:Rule ;
    rdfs:label "One year from Rig Release Date, subject to earlier ending and Sections 6.2-6.5" ;
    ct:description "6.1  Except as provided in Sections 6.2, 6.3, 6.4, and 6.5, this Agreement shall terminate one (1) year from the Rig Release Date, if such has not been terminated sooner pursuant to the provisions hereof." ;
    ct:duration "P1Y"^^xsd:duration ;
    ct:kind "INITIAL_TERM" ;
    ct:references_section ex:H05R01F1 ;
    ct:starts_from ex:H05R01F0 ;
    ct:supported_by ex:H05R01P .

ex:H08R01 a ct:Rule ;
    rdfs:label "Signing-date term and extension durations are redacted" ;
    ct:description """8. DURATION

This JV Agreement shall become effective on the signing date and shall have a duration of * years, extendable for a further * years, unless notice of non- renewal is sent one year before the natural expiry date.

This JV shall automatically cease to be effective on the date when the JV is wound-up or is the target of any kind of insolvency procedure.

Termination of this JV Agreement shall not relieve the Parties of their obligations due at the time of such termination, nor shall such termination prejudice any claim of either Party accrued, or to accrue, on account of any default or breach by the other Party.""" ;
    ct:duration_status "REDACTED" ;
    ct:kind "INITIAL_TERM" ;
    ct:starts_from ex:H08R01F0 ;
    ct:subject_to ex:H08R01C ;
    ct:supported_by ex:H08R01P .

ex:H10R01 a ct:Rule ;
    rdfs:label "Ten years from first public content availability; automatic three-year renewals" ;
    ct:description "INITIAL TERM AND RENEWALS: This Agreement will become effective as of the last date of signature (Effective Date) and shall, unless sooner terminated as provided below or as otherwise agreed, remain effective for an initial term of 10 Years following the first date of public availability of the PACIFICAP ENTERTAINMENT Content within a THE HENRY FILM AND ENTERTAINMENT CORPORATION Property (the \"Initial Term\"). After the Initial Term, this Agreement will be automatically renewed for successive additional 3~year periods (\"Extension Terms\"), unless otherwise terminated by either party by giving notice to the other party not less than sixty (60) days prior to the end of a Term. As used herein, the \"Term\" means the Initial Term and any Extension Term(s)." ;
    ct:duration "P10Y"^^xsd:duration ;
    ct:kind "INITIAL_TERM" ;
    ct:starts_from ex:H10R01F0 ;
    ct:subject_to ex:H10R01C ;
    ct:supported_by ex:H10R01P .

ex:H15R01 a ct:Rule ;
    rdfs:label "Agreement through Delivery Period; certain licenses survive" ;
    ct:description "6.1 Term.   (i) Term of Agreement. This Agreement shall commence on the Effective Date and, except as set forth in Subsection (ii), continue in full force and effect through the Delivery Period.   (ii) Term of Licenses. Notwithstanding Subsection (i), certain license grants for Content, Images and Affinities extend beyond the expiration or earlier termination of this Agreement as set forth herein. With respect to such Content, Images and Affinities, the terms and conditions of this Agreement shall continue to apply." ;
    ct:ends_on_event ex:H15R01F1 ;
    ct:kind "INITIAL_TERM" ;
    ct:starts_from ex:H15R01F0 ;
    ct:supported_by ex:H15R01P .

ex:H16R01 a ct:Rule ;
    rdfs:label "Three years with automatic two-year extensions unless advised otherwise" ;
    ct:description "VI. TERM/TERMINATION   A. The Term will be 3 years from Effective Date with an automatic 2 year term extensions unless otherwise advised by one of the Parties." ;
    ct:duration "P3Y"^^xsd:duration ;
    ct:kind "INITIAL_TERM" ;
    ct:starts_from ex:H16R01F0 ;
    ct:supported_by ex:H16R01P .

ex:H17R01 a ct:Rule ;
    rdfs:label "Effective on date hereof, ends upon termination of Offering" ;
    ct:description """13. Termination and Payment of Expenses. This Agreement shall become effective on the date hereof and shall terminate upon the termination of the Offering. If for any reason any Shares are not delivered by or on behalf of the Company as provided herein, the Company will reimburse the Agent for all actual and accountable out-of-pocket expenses, including fees and disbursements of counsel, reasonably incurred by the Agent in making preparations for the purchase, sale and delivery of the Shares not so delivered, but the Company shall then be under no further liability to the Agent except as provided in Section 8 and Section 10 hereof.

10""" ;
    ct:ends_on_event ex:H17R01F1 ;
    ct:kind "INITIAL_TERM" ;
    ct:starts_from ex:H17R01F0 ;
    ct:supported_by ex:H17R01P .

ex:H19R01 a ct:Rule ;
    rdfs:label "Agreement period January 1, 2019 through December 31, 2023" ;
    ct:description """AGREEMENT PERIOD

Effective Date: January 1, 2019

Termination Date: December 31, 2023""" ;
    ct:kind "INITIAL_TERM" ;
    ct:starts_from ex:H19R01F0 ;
    ct:stated_end_date "2023-12-31"^^xsd:date ;
    ct:supported_by ex:H19R01P .

ex:H01R01 a ct:Rule ;
    rdfs:label "24-month initial term, Appendix qualification and automatic half-year extension" ;
    ct:description "7.1  Unless  otherwise  stated  in  the  Appendix  the  term of this letter           Agreement  shall  continue  for  twenty-four  (24)  months  with  the           effective  date  unless  terminated sooner or extended pursuant to the           terms hereof (\"Initial Term\"). The Initial Term shall automatically be           extended  for  an additional period of half a year unless either party           provides  the  other party with written notification of termination of           the  letter  Agreement  at  least 60 days prior to end of such period." ;
    ct:duration "P2Y"^^xsd:duration ;
    ct:kind "INITIAL_TERM" ;
    ct:references_section ex:H01R01F1 ;
    ct:starts_from ex:H01R01F0 ;
    ct:subject_to ex:H01R01C ;
    ct:supported_by ex:H01R01P .

ex:H06R01 a ct:Rule ;
    rdfs:label "Employment begins 26 September 2019 and continues until notice under paragraph 11" ;
    ct:description """1.1 This Agreement shall take effect 26  September 2019 (the "Effective Date").

1.2 Your employment shall commence on 26  September 2019 and shall continue unless and until either party gives notice to the other in accordance with paragraph 11 below. No employment with a previous employer is deemed to be continuous with your employment with the Company.""" ;
    ct:kind "INITIAL_TERM" ;
    ct:references_section ex:H06R01F1 ;
    ct:starts_from ex:H06R01F0 ;
    ct:supported_by ex:H06R01P .

ex:H12R01 a ct:Rule ;
    rdfs:label "Seven years plus automatic annual renewals" ;
    ct:description "15.1 Term. This Agreement is effective on the Effective Date. Unless earlier terminated as provided herein, this Agreement continues in effect for an initial term of seven (7) years (\"Initial Term\") and will automatically renew for one or more annual periods after the Initial Term (each a \"Renewal Term\") unless either party gives notice of non-renewal at least one hundred eighty (180) days prior to the beginning of any Renewal Term." ;
    ct:duration "P7Y"^^xsd:duration ;
    ct:kind "INITIAL_TERM" ;
    ct:starts_from ex:H12R01F0 ;
    ct:subject_to ex:H12R01C ;
    ct:supported_by ex:H12R01P .

ex:H18R01 a ct:Rule ;
    rdfs:label "Default twelve-month service terms with exhibit-specific dates" ;
    ct:applies_within ex:H18R01F1 ;
    ct:description "Section 6.1 Term of Services. With respect to each of the Services, the term thereof will be for a period commencing as of the date hereof, unless a different date is specified as the commencement date for any applicable Service on Exhibit A or Exhibit B (either, a \"Commencement Date\"), and shall continue until 12 months following the Commencement Date unless (i) such other date as is specified as the termination date for any applicable Service in this Agreement or on Exhibit A or Exhibit B, as applicable (the \"Term\") or (ii) earlier terminated pursuant to this Agreement (a \"Termination Date\")." ;
    ct:duration "P1Y"^^xsd:duration ;
    ct:kind "INITIAL_TERM" ;
    ct:starts_from ex:H18R01F0 ;
    ct:subject_to ex:H18R01C ;
    ct:supported_by ex:H18R01P .

